h":833036722,"text":"Uhh, you say that, but Paimon's suddenly getting kinda nervous.","nextNodeIds":[726890106]},{"nodeId":726890106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":1709511530,"text":"Hehe, there's no need to fret. Just relax. Relax...","nextNodeIds":[726890107]},{"nodeId":726890107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":1211256570,"text":"Considering your talent, I believe that you merely need to give the theme due consideration.","nextNodeIds":[726890108,726890111]},{"nodeId":726890108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":672997866,"text":"You flatter us, but do go ahead.","nextNodeIds":[726890109]},{"nodeId":726890109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":1338299834,"text":"In that case, today's theme is \"the jade leaves do repose, the flowers are born in the wind.\"","nextNodeIds":[726890110]},{"nodeId":726890110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":2392242298,"text":"I wonder what answer the two of you will give...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726890111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4179946154,"text":"I've got some other things to do at the moment...","nextNodeIds":[726890112]},{"nodeId":726890112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":1059654714,"text":"That's alright. Ikebana requires one's full attention, after all.","nextNodeIds":[726890113]},{"nodeId":726890113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"Fushizome","textMapHash":4026471762,"text":"Once you have completed the various tasks you have on hand, rendering yourself free of disturbances, I'm certain that your floral courtyard shall be all the more perfect for it.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL"